window.products.push({"id":977008,"name":"Judith Stiles Designs Small Shell Dish with Cherry Wood Spoon, White/Peach","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SoRzgNEGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From her Cape Cod studio, Judith Stiles creates original ceramics inspired by the wonderful textures and vibrant colors of the seashore. She uses the finest Georgia Kaolin clay and hand-blended oxides to make each piece unique, and the beautiful color tones and textures are the result of her artistic handpainting and airbrushing. The dish is perfect for candy or condiments, and a handmade cherry wood spoon is included. Judith Stiles has taught ceramics at Skidmore College and the Pratt Art Institute, and her work has been praised in numerous publications including The New Yorker, Architectural Digest and Metropolitan Home. She holds an MFA from the University of Massachusetts with a concentration in glaze chemistry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SoRzgNEGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Judith Stiles Designs","source_asin":"B00JMFLH1A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-977008","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JMFLH1A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JMFLH1A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
