window.products.push({"id":977028,"name":"Cast Paper Art CPAFFS3 Note Cards Hummingbird (1 pk 5 cards)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91uJ1ic7+TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cast Paper Art - Note Cards - Hummingbird (1 pk - 10 cards) An eco-conscious product line that blossoms into flowers. Remarkably innovative Stationary and Note cards made from 100% recycled cotton and abaca fibers, which when planted blossom into perennial wildflowers that attract and nurture the endangered honey bee. Each is printed with a realistic bird illustration. Our Meant-To-Bee Feathered Friends Notes and Stationary are available in White only. Includes 10 handmade notes, blank writing inserts, planting instructions and matching envelopes. Packs come in all one style of bird.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91uJ1ic7+TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cast Paper Art","source_asin":"B002XLVPD0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-977028","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002XLVPD0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002XLVPD0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":977029,"name":"NTR 10400mAh Portable Camping Fan, 36Hrs Rechargeable Fan with LED Lantern and Hook, 270° Rotatable Cordless Tent Fan, Hanging Fan for Camping, Outdoo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617kGjExWvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【10400mAh large-capacity battery】 Compared with most 7800mAh fans for camping, the NTR camping ceiling fans for tents has a built-in 10400mAh rechargeable lithium battery, which can work continuously for 8-36 hours. And equipped with 4 indicator lights to remind you to charge in time. A fully charged battery lasts overnight, bringing you longer lasting coolness. It also supports working while charging, does not heat up during use, and is also safe for children. 【Quiet & Strong Airflow】The camp fan for tent adopts professional brushless motor and ultra-thin fan blades, which can provide you with super-strong airflow (10ft/sec) with low noise (<30db). The wind distance can reach 3 meters to keep the air circulating inside the tent without disturbing your work and sleep, creating a soothing relief. 【3 Level Adjustable LED Light】The camping lantern fan has 3 brightness settings (30%, 70%, 100%), the lowest brightness can emit soft and non-dazzling light, suitable for reading or studying at night. The highest brightness can illuminate the entire tent or hike at night. NTR lighted tent fan is one of the must-have equipment for outdoor travel. 【2A Quick Charging Design】Our camping fan for tent uses Type-C USB charging port, 2A quick charging takes 5 hours to charge. The tent ceiling fan for camping supports USB power sources such as PCs, notebooks, mobile power supplies, and car chargers. Usb camping fan can also work while charging, allowing it to work 24/7. The ideal companion for camping, fishing and hiking! 【Stepless speed regulation】 Compared with ordinary multi-stage speed regulation, the stepless speed regulation of NTR tent fans for camping adopts knob control, and the wind speed control is more sensitive. By fine-tuning, you can find the most suitable wind speed for you, cool but not cold. 【Adjustable Angle and Hook Design】The hanging tent fan has a 270° adjustable head and 12 stop positions, with a very wide rotation range, giving you the best airflow direction control. There are retractable hooks on the bottom so you can hang the fan and place it anywhere, such as on top of tents, hammocks, and RVs. Enjoy the homemade breeze. 【High Performance Material】NTR mini ceiling tent fan housing is made of high-performance ABS material. Compared with ordinary materials, our fan has better durability and impact resistance. The compact structure of 10x8.3x5 inches does not take up much space and is convenient for storage. It is the perfect partner for outdoor enthusiasts. 【Quality Assurance】We provide a half-year warranty, if you are not satisfied within half a year, please feel free to contact us, we will solve the problem for you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617kGjExWvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NTR","source_asin":"B092R7N95N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-977029","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092R7N95N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092R7N95N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":977030,"name":"Frame USA Architect Series 24x36 Wood Photo and Art Frames (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZReUHrTxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you want to add a stylish contemporary accent to your images, look no further than the Frame USA Architect Series Wood Picture Frame. A thin, minimalistic design gives this frame a simple elegance that makes a favorable impression both at home and in professional settings. Rich staining lets the grain patterning of this real wood frame shine through for a subtle touch of natural beauty. The molding measures 3/4-inch wide and 3/4-inch deep and features a squared-off face for a neat appearance. The 24x36 frame comes with a durable styrene front for protection, and the included sawtooth and flat cardboard backing ensure quick and easy hanging. For over 35 years, Frame USA has created ready-made and custom photo and art frames for customers across the United States. Each picture frame is proudly American-made in our warehouse in Cincinnati, Ohio.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZReUHrTxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Frame USA","source_asin":"B07C5TJJW4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-977030","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C5TJJW4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C5TJJW4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
