window.products.push({"id":977044,"name":"BioSense Luxe Pillow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UbegUVEIL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"BioSense Luxe Pillow. For those who want the support of memory foam and the comfort of down. BioSense memory foam is designed to help support all sleepers and conforms to the precise contours of your head and neck BioSense LoftTM technology makes the foam softer and lighter weight, but with the same support as traditional memory foam Down feather-filled cotton cover provides a soft sleep surface Memory foam includes 3 natural ingredients to help neutralize odors: seed oil, green tea and charcoal 300 thread-count cotton cover is removable and washable Pressure-relieving BioSense memory foam cradles your head and neck. The Luxe Pillow is perfect for anyone who wants the added support of memory foam, but enjoys the soft, lofty feel of a down-filled pillow. It is traditionally shaped to support all sleepers and perfectly supports the contours of your head, neck and shoulders. It even \"re-sets\" itself as you change positions throughout the night. All that support is then wrapped up in a down-filled cotton cover to give you a pillow that never needs fluffing. New BioSense LoftTM technology keeps weight to a minimum. Traditional memory foam pillows are comfortable, but they can also be heavy. Our Luxe Pillow is made with using BioSense LoftTM technology, which results in a lighter weight foam that still offers the incredible support and comfort you expect from memory foam. Includes natural ingredients to neutralize odors. Our BioSense memory foam is made with the perfect combination of green tea, charcoal and seed oil to help naturally neutralize odors. Treat yourself to our most comfortable pillow yet! Order your BioSense Luxe Pillow from Brookstone today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UbegUVEIL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brookstone","source_asin":"B013KEQ4MK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-977044","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B013KEQ4MK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B013KEQ4MK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
