window.products.push({"id":977080,"name":"Bakhoor Estabraq - Incense Bakhoor by Asgharali","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71N0UtOovCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The usage of bakhoor has become a deep-rooted custom, from religious ceremonies, traditional weddings and festivals to its use in times of cheerfulness. Here we have for you BAKHOOR ESTABRAQ with its natural fresh notes to enliven your senses. Top Notes: Bergamont, Cinnamon Bark, Mandarin, Pepper Heart Notes: Cedarwood , Geranium,Lavandin, Sandalwood Base Notes: Amber, Musk, Tonka Bean, Vanilla How to Ignite/Use the Bakhoor - Bakhoor (incense) is a substance that will not light up without a burner. A burner (Mubkhar) and charcoal is always required to burn the bakhoor/incense. - If you are using an electrical burner, then charcoal is not required. An electric burner must get extremely hot for the Bakhoor to burn properly. - Our recommendation is to use the regular ceramic burner with charcoal to burn the Bakhoor slowly emitting the smoke of fragrance. All you have to do is have access to the regular ceramic burner, bakhoor and the charcoal discs. You should burn a charcoal disc till it glows red on the burner. - Put a small piece(s) of Bakhoor on the lit glowing charcoal or on the hot plate of the electric incense burner. You shall see immediately the smoke rising from the charcoal and can start smelling the fragrance. The fragrance stays there after the smoke goes away. For a complete experience of the fragrance, leave the doors/windows closed till the room is saturated with the fragrance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71N0UtOovCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Asgharali Perfumes","source_asin":"B075J1H44C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-977080","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075J1H44C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075J1H44C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":977081,"name":"InPlace Shelving 0191832 18-Inch Wide Clear Glass Bracketed Wall Shelf","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5193joi6USL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Organize your home and free countertops from clutter with this stylish shelf. This tempered glass floating shelf with silver brackets has a beautiful clean design. The shelf measures 18\" wide x 2.5\" deep x 2\" high, and has a load capacity of 5 lbs.These shelves are simple to install and all mounting hardware and instructions are included. They hang on walls with no visible screws, connectors, or tracks. These shelves pair beautifully with modern, beach, or spa design themes. These floating shelves offer attractive storage space for laundry rooms, mud rooms, kitchens, and more! Buy two or three together to fill empty wall space and display functional items like dishes, pictures, candles, towels, laundry soap, kitchen items, or children's stuffed animals. This shelf will perfectly complement the wall decor in your home.Established in 1930, Hyman Inc. has been built on the principles of quality, service, and innovation. Known for marketing innovative home decor and building products for over 85 years, we provide a wide range of home accessories and improvement products for consumers, pros, and home decorators. Today, Lewis Hyman, Inc. and LH Licensed Products Inc. are jointly marketed as Hyman Inc. Our corporate headquarters in Carson, CA includes a 100,000 square foot distribution facility. Our Atlanta, GA office largely supports our e-commerce business and continues to provide our “quick ship” program to the east coast and the southeastern United States. We currently have showrooms in both office locations to collaborate with our partners and customers from all over the world. Finally, we also offer our trade customers access to these same services from our offices in North Carolina, Portugal, Hong Kong, and Shanghai.Use your Amazon gift card and search our other amazing products at our Amazon storefront. From the Manufacturer It's easy to organize and clear clutter from counter tops with this modern, sleek, glass wall shelf with silver brackets. This contemporary glass shelf is perfect for bathroom storage of cotton balls, soap dishes and other accessories, or for displaying decorative items in any room where you want a modern look.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5193joi6USL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"InPlace Shelving","source_asin":"B00I60COXM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-977081","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00I60COXM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00I60COXM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
