window.products.push({"id":977182,"name":"Christmas Hanging Handmade Crafted Shatterproof Home Decoration, Colorful Festive Decorative Ornaments, Bell Collection, Table Decorations for Party, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AgTybdLjL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Do you know what is a significance of bells? Traditionally Bells announce the coming or arrival of an event, activity, or occasion. Bells rung during Christmas to announce the arrival of the season, to proclaim the birth of Christ. They are herald in the New Year. Bells are rung to announce the union of a man and a woman. The bells on offer are a real delight to the eye. Perfect for hanging in living room, bedroom, corridor, office, really anywhere in your home. Try hanging them on a wall, windows, curtains, a staircase. Makes a lovely addition on special occasions, like Birthday party, Baby shower, Wedding, Anniversary or any Festive celebration. Make bright bell garland. With rainbow colors and light texture it will be a perfect addition to nursery or kid's bedroom, play room, corridor, class or your office. Adorable, bells will be perfect on a baby crib sides, bedheads, shelves, mirrors, curtains and much more. Just use your imagination! Surely, they will add a joy to a festive season and can be any party favors or great decorations for a wedding. These decorative ornaments are eco-friendly and handmade product which designed and made by women in India united into ethical organisation with a vision to empower women. By purchasing this product, you would support bringing marginalised Indian families out of poverty cycle, helping these families with education, health and savings. The ornaments made with mainly using the papier mache technique which is a composite material consisting of paper pieces or pulp, sometimes reinforced with textiles, bound with an adhesive such as glue, starch or wallpaper paste. The size of a bell: 2” (5 cm) height and about the same in diameter, the weight is about 0.53 ounce (15g) each. Due to a nature of production designs of the bells can differ as well as the size and the weight.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AgTybdLjL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hesinil","source_asin":"B08GPGFWR4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-977182","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GPGFWR4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GPGFWR4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
