window.products.push({"id":977190,"name":"Red Co. 10 Oz Clear Short Glasses Set of 6 with Colored Base, Iced Tea Water Drinking Tumblers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7121d-sWI-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These elegant drinking glasses are perfect for your next gathering. The size is just right for a glass of water, cocktail, juice, or smoothie. The glass set comes in 6 different colored base giving you that sense of individuality. It also comes in handy when you don't know which drink is yours. Simply remember the color of the glass. Add instant glamor to your bar top, tray, shelves and table with these stunning sleek glasses. A sophisticated gift for a special person who enjoys the finer things in life. This set would make the perfect birthday, anniversary, housewarming, Christmas and holiday gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7121d-sWI-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Red Co.","source_asin":"B08XS73N15","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-977190","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XS73N15","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XS73N15","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":977191,"name":"Armen Living Lily Dining Chair in Grey Faux Leather and Walnut Wood Finish 20 x 31 x 23","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":152.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i-ZD+TdIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Armen Living Lily mid-century dining chair is designed to add sophistication to any contemporary home decor. The curved hardwood walnut back is upholstered with soft faux leather and sports a beautiful diamond button tuft, wrapping you in comfort while you dine or entertain. This modern side chair features walnut finished legs which combine the durability of metal with the natural beauty of wood. This is an alluring design that you can play up or down in any room in your home. It is the perfect size for small spaces such as dorm rooms or apartments or it can be used to entertain large gatherings in style. The high cushion back is ideal for posture alignment and an unmatched support for days on end. The detailed diamond design pattern creates a glamorous but yet sophisticated feel to the product. The foundation of the product is supported by solid walnut wood for a sturdy and stylish aesthetic without comprising the practicality and functionality of this item. This item is a versatile piece that can be ideal for dining, kitchen, or even home office desk chairs. We stand by the quality, the craftsmanship, and the integrity of our product by offering a 1-year warranty for all our products. We want our customers to enjoy our product and we will always be there to help with our top-notch customer service support. The Lily is available in your choice of black or gray faux leather. Product Dimensions: 20\"W x 23\"D x 31\"H SH: 18\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i-ZD+TdIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Armen Living","source_asin":"B0BZKSN34V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-977191","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZKSN34V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZKSN34V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
