window.products.push({"id":977389,"name":"Nanalou 2 Pack Wood Bead Garland | Add a Touch of Boho Style to Your Farmhouse Décor with All-Natural, Handmade Wooden Bead Garland (Natural)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NxdLF+6SS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a touch of rustic boho elegance to your home decor with an all-natural wood bead garland. Handcrafted with love by Brazilian artisans, every wooden bead garland is unique. Are you looking for a gorgeous wooden bead garland to add the final touch to a tiered tray, table decoration, or simply to drape around a table lamp? Perhaps you're looking for a unique set of wooden beads with cute and natural tassels to complete your home's rustic farmhouse décor. You may even just be looking for a boho photo prop that adds the final touch to your home and lifestyle photography. No matter how you plan to use wood bead garlands, they are a fantastic way to add a new and charming dimension to any space – especially if you're going for the rustic look of shabby chic! Made from solid Brazilian walnut wood together with Brazilian jute, these wood bead garlands are a quick and easy way to create talking points in any home setting. The only limit is your imagination! Hung, coiled, or draped, the beads add variety, color, and texture to your home décor – with no rules on how your home should wear its all-natural jewelry, you can take your rustic farmhouse vision to the very next level. Choose from a natural style that emphasizes the rich tones of walnut wood or a range of colors, including blue and red. Available with 19mm beads or 12mm beads, Nanalou offers a choice beyond the standard 15mm offered by others, giving you plenty of decoration options – no matter what your style. Want to get crafty and decorate your wood beads to make them even more personal? We recommend purchasing the natural wood stain for a neutral background palette that lets you unleash your creative ideas or choosing a painted color that matches your color scheme. It is easy to give your home décor that extra 'wow' factor with high quality, handmade wooden bead garlands while supporting an ethical program that supports communities of talented artisans in Brazil.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NxdLF+6SS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nanalou","source_asin":"B095411MKB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-977389","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095411MKB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095411MKB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
