window.products.push({"id":977423,"name":"6 Inch Square Baking Pan, Deedro Square Cake Pan Stainless Steel Lasagna Brownie Pan, Toaster Oven Pan Deep Baking Pan, One-piece Molding & Leak proof","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61l0mf3fhJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💜💜💜 Bake yummy cakes for next birthday, holiday, festival with Deedro Square Cake Pan! 🎄 ADVANTAGES 🎄 🎁 Healthy Material : Make of high quality food grade stainless steel, no extra aluminum or other unhealthy chemical materials into you food. 🎁 Exquisite Design : One-piece mold design avoid leaking and keep your oven neat, no any sharp angles and spots for a comfortable holding. 🎁 Round Corner : This square cake pan has round corners, so you don’t have to worry about your cake will be stuck to the tight corner and torn during unmolding. 🎁 Rust Resistance : Stainless steel has a strong ability to resist rust, corrosion and deformation, sturdy construction for durability and long-serving time. 🎁 Brushed Finish : Deedro square baking pan features brushed finish for abrasion and stain resistance, cleaning is a breeze by hand, also dishwasher safe. 🎁 Full Uniform Heating : Superior ability to transfer oven heat to all sides of the pan rapidly, heats evenly without hot spots so your baked goods come out of the oven perfectly. 🎁 Versatility : Practical to make multiple dishes, like square cakes, lasagna, bread, vegetables, meat and more, great choice for housewarming, Christmas gift for your families or friends. 🛍️ SPECIFICATION 🛍️ 🔹 Material: 430 Stainless Steel 🔹 Package Content: 1 x Square Cake Pan 🔹 Dimensions: Upper: 6.3 x 6.3 x 2 inch Bottom: 5.5 x 5.5 x 2 inch 🍄 USING INSTRUCTION 🍄 1. Please wash the square cake pans with warm water before first using to wash off the residue left from manufacturing. 2. Please use soft dishcloth to clean the square baking pans for the beauty of its smooth surface. 3. Please clean and dry the square baking pans after using, store them in dry place for their durability. 4. Recommend to grease the pan or use parchment paper on the bottom to avoid food sticking.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61l0mf3fhJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deedro","source_asin":"B08PB91YZ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-977423","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PB91YZ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PB91YZ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":977424,"name":"Hiteenyian Christmas Garland,with LED Lights Green Artificial Wreath for Holiday Wedding Party, Xmas Decoration,Outdoor/Indoor Use","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LvOCmp7RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Festive Appearance】: Featured with 220 pine needle branches, 6 flowers, 30 Christmas balls, Vibrant colors, high quality, requires no special cleaning or maintenance. Easy to store and can be used repeatedly. This artificial christmas garland will look great all the time.create a lively feel to your holiday decor and match any of your existing Christmas Decor. 【CHRISTMAS GARLAND WITH LIGHTS】: Pre-strung with 30 warm white LED light, which is more bright and festival splendid than other 24inch Christmas garland.cordless prelit garland operated by 3 AA batteries (not included). You can place the festive fairy lights anywhere in your home without worry of needing a socket nearby. 【SUPERIOR MATERIAL】: Made from PVC with metal wire construction so that you can easily form the shape you want and position it as you like，measures 8.8 ft/2.7m, provides you with a lot of freedom to use it wherever you please. can easily form the shape you want and position it as you like wrapped around the Christmas tree, along a mantelpiece or twist it around the banisters of a staircase. 【OUTDOOR/INDOOR DECORATION】: Whether you only need 5.9 feet for the mantel, 12 feet draping over a doorframe, or 24 feet for the stair banisters, this Xmas garland has you covered. Just use multiple garlands together to create the length you need. 【SATISFACTION GUARANTEED】: As always, if you remain unsatisfied with this Xmas garland, please contact us for your money back! We would love to hear and understand your questions and concerns. Customer happiness is our number one priority!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LvOCmp7RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hiteenyian","source_asin":"B09G9TCFS1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-977424","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09G9TCFS1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09G9TCFS1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
