window.products.push({"id":977439,"name":"3/16 Terminal Microwave Diode Compatible for GE WB27X10744 WB27X10849 and Others 2 PCS","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41fJ3ePjOnL._AC_SL1125_.jpg","description":"Generic Microwave High Voltage Diode 2 PCS for You Microwave diode's valve voltage is more than 3 VDC, so many digital multifunction meters can not test it bad or not, because only 3 VDC battery inside Advise to use traditional anolog meter to test it because it has 9 VDC battery inside Particularly notice that newly and hot selling microwaves' high capacitor is 3/16in standard(4.8x0.5mm) female spade termninal, Ohmmonburged provide relative high voltage microwave diode for you! Check your HV capacitor and diode's female terminal size first before you purchase, normally 3/16 in standard terminal is smaller than 1/4 in obviously by eye view Pack Items: 2 PCS Common Questions and Answer by Seller Question 1:Does this diode universal and generic for microwave high voltage diode? Answer:Yes. Most home microwave high voltage diode's withstand voltage is 12kv, rated current is 350mA(0.35 amp). Few are 450 mA rated current,normally it is diode CL04-12. Question 2: What will be happen when microwave diode broken? Answer: It will not heat food. High voltage fuse after transformer will burnt. Question 3: How can I check hv diode broken or not? Answer:First check the low voltage side's fuse(power input side) burnt or not,then check high voltage fuse after transformer burnt or not, if burnt, the hv diode is broken or burnt. Finally you can check diode good or broken with a electrical meter. Final Remark: 1. Safe is first, power off and conform high voltage capacitor released high voltage first 2. Check your old and original diode's terminal size first, some old microwave's female spade terminal is 1/4 in standard, yet this is 3/16 in standard. 3. Ohmmonburged will provide some 3/16 in female spade standard diode for you now.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41fJ3ePjOnL._AC_SL1125_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BlueNatHxRPR","source_asin":"B07P2XQ9CG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-977439","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P2XQ9CG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P2XQ9CG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
