window.products.push({"id":977465,"name":"Vacuum Sealer Machine with Starter Kit , TKTK 8 in 1 Powerful Sous Vide Food Vacuum Sealer, Seal a Meal Food Sealer with Pulse Function, Moist&Dry Mod","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71R7m+LD6KL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"👉[One-Touch Operation & 8 Functions] Moist & Dry Modes - Maximize freshness for different types of food; Pulse- Control the vacuum pressure manually; Vac Seal- One touch operation; Canister- External vac for jars, canisters and wine preservation; Build in cutter- Easily customize bag size; Seal- Quick seal only; Seal time + -increase the sealing time; Cancel- Cancel the current process at any time. 🥩[10 X Longer Freshness & Money Saver] TKTK upgraded powerful vacuum pump provides strong and stable suction, along with advanced sealing technology, keeping your food fresh for up to 10 X times longer and saving your money & fridge space. (notes: Stop working for 2 minutes, the machine will enter sleep mode, touch the screen button to wake up the machine. ) ✨[Compact Design & Easy to Clean] 15.3\"x5.9\"x3.5\" compact design saves countertop space; 11.8\" maximum sealing length allows you to seal multiple bags in one sealing time; Stainless steel and ABS material, easier for you to clean. Keep the upper lid of the appliance unlocked when not in use. 🎁[Full Starter Kits for Family] A cost-friendly option for Family. Package includes: 1 x Vacuum Sealer, 5 x Heat-seal bags (11.8''x8.7'' x 5pcs), 1 x Roll Vacuum Bag(2 m), 1 x External air suction hose, 1 x User Manual, 1x AC Power Cord,1 x wine stopper,1 x Mark pen, 1 x 3mm Heating Bar Tape. 🏆[TKTK Quality & Warranty] Each product goes through rigorous quality testing before leaving the factory.TKTK offers 30 days money-back guarantee, 1-year warranty, and a lifetime technical consultation. TKTK valaue the experience of our customers. All problems will be solved within 24 working hours. ❗❗❗[CAUTIONS] 1. When the heating function is used continuously, an interval of 15 s is required. 2. Sealer only works when the lid is properly closed. 3. Heating 20 times in a row requires 25 minutes of rest. 4. For vacuum sealing you need special foil bags with structure honeycombs. Smooth bags do not work. 5. Keep the upper lid of the appliance unlocked when not in use. ❗❗❗[CAUTIONS] The heating sealing strip will be very hot after the product works. Please do not touch it with your hands.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71R7m+LD6KL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TKTK","source_asin":"B092M3CVLL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-977465","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092M3CVLL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092M3CVLL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
