window.products.push({"id":977574,"name":"Instant Read Meat Thermometer For Cooking,Fast Digital BBQ Grill Food Probe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CZVXYICPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SO EASY TO USE - WORKS RIGHT OUT THE BOX! Remove the cap, press the power button, insert the tip into your food, and you will have an accurate and easy to read temperature displayed on the dial. Pocket-sized quick-read thermometer that's great for measuring temperature in thin cuts of meat, fish or poultry; Large easy read LCD, button for Fahrenheit/Celsius conversions; Handle non-slip design,plastic protective sheath can be used as a handle extension; it has a pocket clip so you can bring it any where when cooking; Unique design, the needle and the case can be formed as a right angle to avoid steam burning when measure liquid; Shatterproof and high heat resistant with wide temperature range from -58 to 570 degrees F (-50 to 300 degrees C); Made of high quality stainless steel and protected by a cap","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CZVXYICPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Honsen","source_asin":"B076HQ9PPL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-977574","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076HQ9PPL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076HQ9PPL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
