window.products.push({"id":977921,"name":"Electric Wine Aerator,Rechargeable Wine Aerator,One-Touch Wine Dispenser,Automatic Wine Aerator with Instant Oxidation,Wine Dispenser Machine,Electric","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nBwSzHxML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Automatic Wine Aerator - You can enjoy your favorite red wine with our wine aerator immediately.Just simply press the button of wine dispenser and the aerated wine is delivered to your wine glass.The electric wine aerator increases the oxidation of the tannins,reducing astringency and drawing out the natural flavors. Convenient Electric Aerator - Compared with other traditional wine aerator decanter,this rechargeable wine dispenser machine is more convenient,quick aerating,one touch,no spilling out,easy to install and clean.You needn’t wait for a long time and will have a wonderful leisure time with your favorite red wine. More Luxurious Taste - This electric wine aerator pourer have 3 processes to sober up,oxygenation,red light and magnetic force.Our electric wine dispenser can retain fragrance,keep mellow and remove fishiness.Meanwhile,the wine also becomes more opulent,with a smoother flavor and richer finish. USB Charging&Wine Accessories - There have usb charging cable,tubes,wine stopper and manual corkscrew in our electric aerator wine package.With 3-4 hours fully charging,the electric wine aerator and dispenser can meet the aerator for 100 bottles of 750ml red wine.The vacuum wine stopper can extend storage time and keep fresh by removing all air from bottle.Manual corkscrew will help you open the original wine cork. Wine Lover Gifts - Perfect gift for wine lovers,whether for self-enjoyment or as a gift.It is an indispensable tool and gift for dating,travel,picnic,party and family gathering.The electric wine air aerator can make everyone feel the real taste of red wine without any waiting.Enjoy the mellow wine by electric aerator,and feel the company,happiness of family and friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nBwSzHxML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SANGFOR","source_asin":"B0BS5F8CF5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-977921","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS5F8CF5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS5F8CF5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
